#. module: tsm_timesheet_commission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tsm_timesheet_commission.field_commission__timesheet_product_id
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Product used to set commissions when there is not time pack in\n"
"        the timesheet line"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Producto utilizado para calcular comisiones cuando no hay una bolsa "
"de horas\n"
" \n"
"        en los partes de trabajo"

#. module: tsm_timesheet_commission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:tsm_timesheet_commission.field_commission__task_stage
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Select the task status for settling the commissions:\n"
"\n"
"        * 'Task Based': Commissions are settled when the task is in\n"
"                        any stage.\n"
"\n"
"        * 'Task Closed': Commissions are settled when the task is in\n"
"                        a closedstage.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Selecciona el estado de la tarea para fijar comisiones:\n"
"\n"
"        * 'Basado en tarea': Son comisionadas cuando la tarea está en "
"cualquier estado. .\n"
"\n"
"        * 'Tareas cerradas': Son comisionadas cuando las tareas está estado "
"cerradas.\n"
"        "

